# The pinned runner for the architecture diagrams.
#
# The `-playwright` variant carries the headless-Chromium renderer, the only exporter
# that honors a committed manual layout and produces the self-contained SVGs the
# guidebook embeds. The plain image cannot export SVG at all.
#
# Pinned exactly, to a release over three days old, like every dependency here. Bumping
# this line is the whole tool upgrade, because the runner tags its image by this file.
